	"data": "cover_letter\n\nChristopher DiCarlo\ncdicarlo28@gmail.com\n508-562-2736\nlinkedin.com/in/chrisdicarlovr\n\nMarch 3, 2026\nHiring Manager\nDelsys Inc.\nDear Hiring Team,\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Software Engineer position at Delsys Inc. As a computer\nscience student graduating in May 2025 with a 3.95 GPA and demonstrated experience in backend development,\nI am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your pioneering work in wearable sensor technology and\nbiosignal processing…",
